& [IndependentContractChecks]
  + domain_separation_and_normalization_match_independent_contract_construction independently builds normalized payload and digest inputs including the fixed context and zero separator
  + normalized_packet_subject_and_request_digest_tamper_refuse proves changed top-level identity is rejected by the upstream validator before A4 admission and request rehash is not an authority upgrade
  + raw witness and retained artifact hashes deliberately differ by the one LF transport terminator; strict typed declaration-order canonical reserialization rejects duplicates unknown fields alternate ordering and trailing forms
  + witness signature covers the normalized complete witness struct with empty signature_hex and sha256(empty) in witness_sha256; supplied lineage names the earlier A3 packet to avoid a digest cycle

