& [LimitsAndDecision]
  + the independent verifier is independent of the fixture producer and reconstructs receipts using the governed upstream and A4 verifiers; it is not a claim of two independently implemented cryptographic algorithms
  + explicit file readers assume stable caller-supplied directories and reject observed links and reparse entries; no atomic filesystem snapshot or OS sandbox is claimed
  + test builds scratch files mock services and subprocesses are verification infrastructure, not A4 runtime effect authority
  + implementation_verified_ready_for_exact_attributed_publication; final TWV-027 and TWV-A04 publication evidence must follow in an immediate bookend
